msgctxt "368_Player"
msgid "(On second thought... Maybe not.)"
msgstr "(Pensándolo bien... quizá no)."

msgctxt "380_Fishing"
msgid "Select your bait, then decide where to cast your line.\\r\n"
"\\r\n"
"Each type of bait has a different range of effect, and the fish won't bite if you use the wrong bait. Items in your possession that can be used as bait will be shown in a list."
msgstr "Seleccione su cebo, después, decida donde lanzar el sedal.\\r\n"
"\\r\n"
"Cada tipo de cebo tiene un rango de efecto diferente, y \\r\n"
"los peces no pican si se usa el cebo incorrecto. Los \\r\n"
"objetos en su posesión que se puedan usar de cebo se \\r\n"
"le mostrarán en una lista."

msgctxt "392_Fishing"
msgid "The gauge shows where fish are most concentrated.\\r\n"
"Use bait that is effective in those areas."
msgstr "La barra muestra dónde se concentran más los peces.\\r\n"
"Utilice cebo efectivo en esas áreas."

msgctxt "404_Fishing"
msgid "Cast your line and wait for a fish to bite.\\r\n"
"\\r\n"
"The <Action:Button_Cross@Fishing> icon will appear when a fish is biting. Quickly press <Action:Button_Cross@Fishing> and reel the line in."
msgstr "Lance el sedal y espere a que un pez muerda el anzuelo.\\r\n"
"\\r\n"
"El ícono <Action:Button_Cross@Fishing> aparecerá cuando un pez pique. \\r\n"
"Presione rápidamente <Action:Button_Cross@Fishing> y recoja el sedal."

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=Fishing
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "416_Fishing"
msgid "<Action:Button_R1@Fishing> reels in, while <Action:Button_L1@Fishing> adds slack. Pay attention to the Tension Gauge, and don't let the fish snap your line. Use <Action:Button_LS_Left@Fishing><Action:Button_LS_Right@Fishing>, following the movement of the fish. Move it up and down to raise or lower the pole."
msgstr "<Action:Button_R1@Fishing> enrolla, mientras que <Action:Button_L1@Fishing> suelta. Preste atención al indicador de tensión y no deje que los peces rompan el sedal. Mueva<Action:Button_LS_Left@Fishing><Action:Button_LS_Right@Fishing> siguiendo el movimiento del pez. Mueva arriba y abajo \\r\n"
"para subir o bajar la caña."

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=4
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P4
#. y4:msg_speaker=Fishing
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "428_Fishing"
msgid "If you control the line's tension and completely reel it in, you will successfully catch the fish."
msgstr "Si controla la tensión del sedal y lo trae entero, \\r\n"
"capturará el pescado con éxito."

